From 961c1b381cca9932e562fcdbad145b3584e455ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] shared: outlined volume panel with open ringer cap

Squashed from:
- 0004-outline-volume-top-sections
- 0006-volume-ringer-open-bottom-cap
- 0009-remove-volume-body-join-seam
- 0010-cover-fractional-density-volume-strokes

Change-Id: Ib472c11b27c8ac628ac939c01ba619f0ec4c93dc

Volume dialog and volume panel sliders: grey inactive track on flat devices (the container role is white).

The floating volume sliders beside the panel get the same 1dp edge.

Dropped the volume_background_top strokes (unreferenced or legacy VolumeDialogImpl only).
